            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.32.9+EXO.32.10+EXO.32.11+EXO.32.12+EXO.32.13+EXO.32.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ukuf 32:9-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.32.31+EXO.32.32+EXO.32.33+EXO.32.34+EXO.32.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "31-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe aebele Mose ati, “Bushe aba bantu bakaleka lilali ukunsuula? Bushe ni lilali bakaleka ukukanancetekela, nangu nabacitile ifipeshamano ifingi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine nkabaponesha icikuko no kubaposafye, lelo iwe nkakucita umushobo ukalamba, kabili uwamaka nganshi ukubacila.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo Mose asosele kuli Yawe ati, “Nomba abena Egupto bali nokumfwa pali ici! Pantu ni ku maka yobe wafumishe aba bantu kuli bena! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili bakebako abekala muli ici calo pali ici. Balya bantu balyumfwa kale ukuti iwe we Yawe waba naba bantu, ulamoneka ku cinso cabo, ne kumbi lyobe liba pa mulu wabo. Ulabatangilila mu ntumba ye kumbi akasuba, elyo ubushiku ubatangilila mu ntumba ya mulilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba nga waipaya aba bantu bonse pa nshita imo, imitundu yonse iyaumfwa ululumbi lobe ikatila, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Yawe nafilwa ukufisha abantu mu calo abalaile no mulapo ukubapeela, eco abepaila mu matololo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi nomba shilanga amaka yobe ukulingana ngefyo wasosele ilyo watile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.5+EXO.20.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ukuf 20:5-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.6+EXO.34.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34:6-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.9+DEU.5.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amaf 5:9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.9+DEU.7.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "7:9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe tafulwa bwangu, kabili alikwatisha icitemwiko icishipwa. Abelela uluse pa bubifi na bucisanguka. Lelo tafilwa ukukanda abamilandu, akanda abana pa bubifi bwa bashibo ukufikafye na ku nkulo yalenga butatu elyo ne yalenga bune. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi ukulingana ne citemwiko icishipwa wakwatisha, belelako aba bantu uluse pa bubifi bwabo. Nga filya fine wababelela uluse ukutula apo bafumina ku Egupto ukufika na nomba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe epakwasuka ati, “Ine nababelela uluse ngefyo walomba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.3.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bahi 3:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba, mu cine cine napalifye ne Mumi, no bucindami bwandi ne Yawe ubwakumana icalo conse, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pali aba bantu tapali nelyo umo uwamona ubucindami bwandi ne fipeshamano nacitile mu Egupto na mu matololo, lelo tabambeela kabili banjesha imiku ikumi limo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tapali nelyo umo uukamona icalo nalaile no mulapo kuli bashibo. Onse uwansuula takacimone iyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
